      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Given the complexity of pain processes, pain relief requires a creative and varied approach. Professional and governmental groups are supporting a holistic approach to pain that results in more positive outcomes for patients. Relaxation techniques provide clients with a strategy for reducing the stress, anxiety, and muscle tension related to pain. Understanding pain, anxiety, and relaxation provides the postanesthesia nurse with an alternative, nonpharmacological method of pain management."},
